        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Tingkum tang the tingkum kathan",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkum tangthe tingkum kathan thaodat the,",
            "Asei tingkum tingmik than pat the;",
            "Jip bam khou rui jip thao o, lung neilana,",
            "Neilana thuan kho tingmik than patmei ta.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Guang o (2), poubaumei thuanku khang,",
            "Kajaujianmei munimei thou cho?",
            "Tingkum khumma gaina gakloumei pu e,",
            "Tingsangjanga kajan kahim dai kandiu.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkum tanga tatmei jianmei nun ramma,",
            "Aniu rui tanpui bam kathui khou;",
            "Sunu-naonian theimei bam khou rui kanlou,",
            "Neilana tanloumei guai thei lai kandiu.",
            "",
            "3. Neilamei gaipui lat hei phunga guange,",
            "Poubaumei guang the suaihiam lou khang;",
            "Poubaumei rui nangta neila lou puni,",
            "Siloumei guai 4@& lunglai na ndao o.",
            "",
            "4. Theikum ta ganlouna tingkum than thuanne,",
            "Nang kai kapumma guanga thuanno;",
            "Thei thu poubaumei suaihiammei la puni,",
            "Neilana thuan kho poubaumei kanloumei."
          ]
        }
      },
